{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"color_scheme":"","wrap_in_card":false,"color_scheme_card":"","hide_header_and_footer":false,"section_width":"normal","layout_type":"flex","layout_flex_direction_desktop":"column","layout_grid_columns_desktop":3,"layout_gap_desktop":20,"layout_wrap_desktop":"nowrap","layout_flex_justify_desktop":"flex-start","layout_flex_align_items_desktop":"flex-start","same_as_desktop":true,"layout_flex_direction_mobile":"column","layout_gap_mobile":20,"layout_wrap_mobile":"nowrap","layout_flex_justify_mobile":"flex-start","layout_flex_align_items_mobile":"flex-start","layout_grid_columns_mobile":1,"padding_top":50,"padding_bottom":50,"margin_top":0,"margin_bottom":0}},"cc_intro":{"type":"custom-code","settings":{"show_on_display":"desktop_and_mobile","custom_liquid":"<div class=\"vllc-hi-head\">\n  <p class=\"vllc-hi-eyebrow\">Notre histoire</p>\n  <h1 class=\"vllc-hi-h1\">Nous ne vendons pas des objets en acier.<br>Nous vendons le moment où<br>la pièce devient belle.</h1>\n  <p class=\"vllc-hi-lead\">Zensea est née d'une vidéo vue à trois heures du matin, et d'un premier handpan qui est arrivé injouable. Voici comment une déception très banale est devenue une maison d'instruments.</p>\n</div>\n<style>\n.vllc-hi-head{max-width:920px;margin:0 auto;padding:76px 24px 10px;text-align:center}\n.vllc-hi-eyebrow{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2.4px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;color:#B98A2E;margin:0 0 16px}\n.vllc-hi-h1{font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:46px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.4px;color:#22332A;margin:0 0 20px}\n.vllc-hi-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.78;color:#5A6B60;margin:0 auto;max-width:640px}\n@media(max-width:600px){.vllc-hi-h1{font-size:29px}.vllc-hi-head{padding-top:54px}.vllc-hi-lead{font-size:15.5px}}\n</style>","margin_top":0,"margin_bottom":0,"additional_class":""},"disabled":true},"txtprem_1":{"type":"txtprem","name":"Image texte prem","settings":{"title":"Une vidéo à deux heures du matin, et une obsession","text":"Un soir de janvier, une vidéo tombe dans le fil. Un type assis en tailleur, un objet en acier sur les genoux, et un son qu'on n'arrive pas à situer : ni percussion, ni cloche, ni harpe. Quelque chose entre les trois.\n\nOn la regarde jusqu'au bout. Puis une autre. Puis on cherche « comment ça s'appelle ». Il est trois heures du matin et on sait deux choses : qu'on en veut un, et qu'on n'a aucune idée de comment en choisir un.","btn_label":"","btn_link":"","image":"","img_position":"left","text_width_desktop":52,"image_width_desktop":51,"text_height_desktop":370,"img_height_desktop":530,"desktop_gap":32,"img_height_mobile":250,"mobile_margin":16,"padding_top":44,"padding_bottom":44,"padding_top_mobile":32,"padding_bottom_mobile":32,"text_padding":32,"text_padding_mobile":32,"title_font":"var(--font-heading-family, Georgia, serif)","text_font":"var(--font-body-family, sans-serif)","button_font":"var(--font-body-family, sans-serif)","title_size_desktop":36,"title_size_mobile":26,"title_weight":"700","title_margin_bottom":20,"title_margin_bottom_mobile":20,"text_size_desktop":16,"text_size_mobile":16,"text_weight":"400","text_line_height":1.8,"text_max_width":720,"text_margin_bottom":32,"text_margin_bottom_mobile":28,"bg_color":"#ffffff","text_bg_color":"#FBF9F4","title_color":"#22332A","text_color":"#4a4a4a","btn_color":"#22332A","btn_text_color":"#ffffff","img_radius":18,"img_radius_mobile":10,"text_radius":18,"btn_size":14,"btn_padding_y":18,"btn_padding_x":36,"btn_padding_y_mobile":20,"btn_radius":4}},"txtprem_2":{"type":"txtprem","name":"Image texte prem","settings":{"title":"Trois semaines à chercher pour ne rien apprendre","text":"Nous avons donc cherché. Des dizaines d'onglets, des marketplaces sans nom, des vidéos filmées au téléphone dans un garage, des fiches produits qui annonçaient « handpan 9 notes » et rien d'autre.\n\nPas de gamme indiquée. Pas d'accordage précisé. Pas un mot sur ce qui distingue un instrument à 200 € d'un instrument à 600 €. Nous avons fini par en commander un au hasard, comme tout le monde.\n\nIl est arrivé désaccordé. Deux notes voisines se déclenchaient l'une l'autre dès qu'on enchaînait. Injouable.","btn_label":"","btn_link":"","image":"","img_position":"right","text_width_desktop":52,"image_width_desktop":51,"text_height_desktop":370,"img_height_desktop":530,"desktop_gap":32,"img_height_mobile":250,"mobile_margin":16,"padding_top":44,"padding_bottom":44,"padding_top_mobile":32,"padding_bottom_mobile":32,"text_padding":32,"text_padding_mobile":32,"title_font":"var(--font-heading-family, Georgia, serif)","text_font":"var(--font-body-family, sans-serif)","button_font":"var(--font-body-family, sans-serif)","title_size_desktop":36,"title_size_mobile":26,"title_weight":"700","title_margin_bottom":20,"title_margin_bottom_mobile":20,"text_size_desktop":16,"text_size_mobile":16,"text_weight":"400","text_line_height":1.8,"text_max_width":720,"text_margin_bottom":32,"text_margin_bottom_mobile":28,"bg_color":"#fdfbf8","text_bg_color":"#FBF9F4","title_color":"#22332A","text_color":"#4a4a4a","btn_color":"#22332A","btn_text_color":"#ffffff","img_radius":18,"img_radius_mobile":10,"text_radius":18,"btn_size":14,"btn_padding_y":18,"btn_padding_x":36,"btn_padding_y_mobile":20,"btn_radius":4}},"txtprem_3":{"type":"txtprem","name":"Image texte prem","settings":{"title":"Le déclic : ce n'est pas l'objet, c'est l'accord","text":"En cherchant, nous avons appris ce que les vendeurs ne racontent jamais. Qu'un handpan n'est pas un objet décoratif mais un instrument accordé à la main, note par note, au marteau. Que la <strong>gamme</strong> décide de tout ce que vous jouerez. Que 440 Hz vous permet de jouer avec les autres, et que 432 Hz vous en empêche.\n\nEt surtout : qu'un instrument bien accordé se reconnaît en cinq secondes. La note tient. Elle ne bave pas sur sa voisine. Elle continue de résonner quand vous avez déjà joué la suivante.","btn_label":"","btn_link":"","image":"","img_position":"left","text_width_desktop":52,"image_width_desktop":51,"text_height_desktop":370,"img_height_desktop":530,"desktop_gap":32,"img_height_mobile":250,"mobile_margin":16,"padding_top":44,"padding_bottom":44,"padding_top_mobile":32,"padding_bottom_mobile":32,"text_padding":32,"text_padding_mobile":32,"title_font":"var(--font-heading-family, Georgia, serif)","text_font":"var(--font-body-family, sans-serif)","button_font":"var(--font-body-family, sans-serif)","title_size_desktop":36,"title_size_mobile":26,"title_weight":"700","title_margin_bottom":20,"title_margin_bottom_mobile":20,"text_size_desktop":16,"text_size_mobile":16,"text_weight":"400","text_line_height":1.8,"text_max_width":720,"text_margin_bottom":32,"text_margin_bottom_mobile":28,"bg_color":"#ffffff","text_bg_color":"#FBF9F4","title_color":"#22332A","text_color":"#4a4a4a","btn_color":"#22332A","btn_text_color":"#ffffff","img_radius":18,"img_radius_mobile":10,"text_radius":18,"btn_size":14,"btn_padding_y":18,"btn_padding_x":36,"btn_padding_y_mobile":20,"btn_radius":4}},"txtprem_4":{"type":"txtprem","name":"Image texte prem","settings":{"title":"Une règle, une seule, tenue depuis le premier jour","text":"Ne jamais proposer un instrument que nous ne garderions pas pour nous.\n\nCette phrase paraît simple ; elle nous a fait refuser plus de cartons que nous n'en avons gardés. Chaque instrument est reçu, sorti de sa boîte, joué note par note, contrôlé au diapason. Ceux qui bavent repartent. Ceux dont la résonance s'éteint en une seconde repartent aussi.\n\nC'est long, c'est coûteux, et c'est la seule chose qui nous distingue vraiment.","btn_label":"","btn_link":"","image":"","img_position":"right","text_width_desktop":52,"image_width_desktop":51,"text_height_desktop":370,"img_height_desktop":530,"desktop_gap":32,"img_height_mobile":250,"mobile_margin":16,"padding_top":44,"padding_bottom":44,"padding_top_mobile":32,"padding_bottom_mobile":32,"text_padding":32,"text_padding_mobile":32,"title_font":"var(--font-heading-family, Georgia, serif)","text_font":"var(--font-body-family, sans-serif)","button_font":"var(--font-body-family, sans-serif)","title_size_desktop":36,"title_size_mobile":26,"title_weight":"700","title_margin_bottom":20,"title_margin_bottom_mobile":20,"text_size_desktop":16,"text_size_mobile":16,"text_weight":"400","text_line_height":1.8,"text_max_width":720,"text_margin_bottom":32,"text_margin_bottom_mobile":28,"bg_color":"#fdfbf8","text_bg_color":"#FBF9F4","title_color":"#22332A","text_color":"#4a4a4a","btn_color":"#22332A","btn_text_color":"#ffffff","img_radius":18,"img_radius_mobile":10,"text_radius":18,"btn_size":14,"btn_padding_y":18,"btn_padding_x":36,"btn_padding_y_mobile":20,"btn_radius":4}},"txtprem_5":{"type":"txtprem","name":"Image texte prem","settings":{"title":"Une gamme, un son, une signature","text":"Nous avons aussi choisi une direction et nous nous y tenons : les gammes mineures, profondes et contemplatives, celles qui donnent au handpan ce son qu'on reconnaît entre mille. L'acier nitruré, sombre et mat. Les formats de 22 pouces, ceux qui tiennent sur les genoux sans écraser.\n\nCe n'est pas un catalogue exhaustif. C'est un point de vue.","btn_label":"","btn_link":"","image":"","img_position":"left","text_width_desktop":52,"image_width_desktop":51,"text_height_desktop":370,"img_height_desktop":530,"desktop_gap":32,"img_height_mobile":250,"mobile_margin":16,"padding_top":44,"padding_bottom":44,"padding_top_mobile":32,"padding_bottom_mobile":32,"text_padding":32,"text_padding_mobile":32,"title_font":"var(--font-heading-family, Georgia, serif)","text_font":"var(--font-body-family, sans-serif)","button_font":"var(--font-body-family, sans-serif)","title_size_desktop":36,"title_size_mobile":26,"title_weight":"700","title_margin_bottom":20,"title_margin_bottom_mobile":20,"text_size_desktop":16,"text_size_mobile":16,"text_weight":"400","text_line_height":1.8,"text_max_width":720,"text_margin_bottom":32,"text_margin_bottom_mobile":28,"bg_color":"#ffffff","text_bg_color":"#FBF9F4","title_color":"#22332A","text_color":"#4a4a4a","btn_color":"#22332A","btn_text_color":"#ffffff","img_radius":18,"img_radius_mobile":10,"text_radius":18,"btn_size":14,"btn_padding_y":18,"btn_padding_x":36,"btn_padding_y_mobile":20,"btn_radius":4}},"txtprem_6":{"type":"txtprem","name":"Image texte prem","settings":{"title":"Aujourd'hui — et ce que nous vous devons","text":"Zensea accompagne des joueurs partout en France : des gens qui n'avaient jamais touché un instrument, des professeurs de yoga, des sophrologues, des parents qui cherchaient un cadeau qui ne finirait pas dans un placard.\n\nCe que nous vous devons est simple : la gamme écrite noir sur blanc, l'accordage vérifié avant l'envoi, le pack complet dans le carton, et quelqu'un qui vous répond en français quand vous bloquez. Le reste, c'est à vous de le jouer.","btn_label":"DÉCOUVRIR NOS INSTRUMENTS","btn_link":"/collections/all","image":"","img_position":"right","text_width_desktop":52,"image_width_desktop":51,"text_height_desktop":370,"img_height_desktop":530,"desktop_gap":32,"img_height_mobile":250,"mobile_margin":16,"padding_top":44,"padding_bottom":44,"padding_top_mobile":32,"padding_bottom_mobile":32,"text_padding":32,"text_padding_mobile":32,"title_font":"var(--font-heading-family, Georgia, serif)","text_font":"var(--font-body-family, sans-serif)","button_font":"var(--font-body-family, sans-serif)","title_size_desktop":36,"title_size_mobile":26,"title_weight":"700","title_margin_bottom":20,"title_margin_bottom_mobile":20,"text_size_desktop":16,"text_size_mobile":16,"text_weight":"400","text_line_height":1.8,"text_max_width":720,"text_margin_bottom":32,"text_margin_bottom_mobile":28,"bg_color":"#fdfbf8","text_bg_color":"#FBF9F4","title_color":"#22332A","text_color":"#4a4a4a","btn_color":"#22332A","btn_text_color":"#ffffff","img_radius":18,"img_radius_mobile":10,"text_radius":18,"btn_size":14,"btn_padding_y":18,"btn_padding_x":36,"btn_padding_y_mobile":20,"btn_radius":4}},"hero":{"type":"hero-vorha","name":"Hero Vorha","settings":{"eyebrow":"Zensea · France","heading":"LE SON NE SE DÉCRIT PAS.","subheading":"IL SE POSE SUR LES GENOUX.","heading_font":"sans_serif_n4","text_font":"sans_serif_n4","bg_color":"#FBF9F4","text_color":"#22332A","section_height":510,"mobile_height":340,"max_width":500,"desktop_offset":-20,"mobile_offset":-10,"eyebrow_size":13,"eyebrow_size_mobile":11,"eyebrow_spacing":0.5,"eyebrow_spacing_mobile":0.4,"eyebrow_margin":22,"eyebrow_margin_mobile":12,"heading_size":72,"heading_size_mobile":31,"heading_weight":"400","heading_weight_mobile":"500","heading_spacing":0,"heading_spacing_mobile":0,"heading_line_height":1,"heading_line_height_mobile":1.1,"heading_margin":30,"heading_margin_mobile":24,"subheading_size":15,"subheading_size_mobile":14,"subheading_spacing":0.4,"subheading_spacing_mobile":0.4,"subheading_line_height":1.4,"subheading_line_height_mobile":1.5,"subheading_mobile_width":340,"mobile_side_padding":24}},"bas_footer":{"type":"velluce-dunes","settings":{"height_desktop":300,"height_mobile":180}},"velluce_hero_3d":{"type":"velluce-hero-3d","settings":{"eyebrow":"Notre histoire","heading":"Du premier son entendu à vos mains.","subheading":"Zensea est née d'un constat simple : trouver un handpan bien accordé, vendu honnêtement, avec sa gamme écrite noir sur blanc, ne devrait pas être un parcours du combattant.","badge_text":"Maison française · Limoges","model_url":"","camera_orbit":"8deg 82deg 0.46m","camera_target":"0m 0m 0m","fov":"30deg","rotation":"11deg"}}},"order":["velluce_hero_3d","main","cc_intro","txtprem_1","txtprem_2","txtprem_3","txtprem_4","txtprem_5","txtprem_6","hero","bas_footer"]}